        }
      ],
      "updated": 1780014455802,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "... etc, proportional to number\nof cores, but not one for each core\nas we will still use one or two OS threads.\n\nEach worker is pinned to a core for reasons\ndescribed in naughty dog talk:\n\n- If an OS thread is scheduled on that core\nand the worker is not pinned, it will be evicted,\nand will be scheduled on another worker threads core\nwhich the OS will realise has been running for a long time and deschedule\n    - a chain reaction will happen as this thread is then scheduled on \n    another worker thread and so on",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "... etc, proportional to number\nof cores, but not one for each core\nas we will still use one or two OS threads.\n\nEach worker is pinned to a core for reasons\ndescribed in naughty dog talk:\n\n- If an OS thread is scheduled on that core\nand the worker is not pinned, it will be evicted,\nand will be scheduled on another worker threads core\nwhich the OS will realise has been running for a long time and deschedule\n    - a chain reaction will happen as this thread is then scheduled on \n    another worker thread and so on",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
