      "updated": 1780013717070,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "RunJobs(); will push jobs to each worker threads apropriate priority queue in turn:\nworker 0 gets the first job, worker 1 gets the next, then worker 2 and so on, wrapping round,\nwith an atomic int keeping track of the next worker to push to",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "RunJobs(); will push jobs to each worker threads apropriate priority queue in turn:\nworker 0 gets the first job, worker 1 gets the next, then worker 2 and so on, wrapping round,\nwith an atomic int keeping track of the next worker to push to",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
